## Late September Nail Ideas (Full Fall Energy)

Where early September holds back, late-month <strong>september nails</strong> lean all the way in. Once the equinox hits and the air actually smells different, the softer palette gives way to something with real weight, and that shift is a relief rather than a compromise.

