## Trending September Nail Art and Textures

Three textures are carrying nearly every standout <strong>september nails</strong> look this year, and each one solves a different part of the seasonal transition problem.

Aura nails are a soft-focus, gradient-style nail art technique where two or more colours are blended into a diffused, cloud-like burst rather than a hard-edged design. For September specifically, an aura in burgundy fading into black or olive fading into gold captures the month's push-and-pull between summer softness and fall depth in a single nail, which is part of why it has become the most repeated technique across nail boards this season.

