Coffin and stiletto shapes still have a place for anyone wanting a bolder style statement, particularly paired with chrome or cat-eye finishes where the flat plane of a coffin nail shows off shifting light especially well. But for the broadest, most versatile take on the season, almond and squoval are doing the most consistent work across salon requests this month.

