## Short vs Long: Which September Nails Should You Get

Both short and long nails work well in September, and the choice comes down to lifestyle rather than trend. Short nails are having a genuine style moment this season, not just a practicality compromise, while longer sets still carry plenty of the month's richer textures beautifully.

